OL,3,GNEWSAParents and teachers have their
OL,4,Asay on restricting phones in schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FEducation Minister Anna Brychan said
OL,7,Fthere would be an expectation that the
OL,8,Fuse of mobile phones is restricted
OL,9,Fduring the school day, but approaches
OL,10,Fcould vary across school sites.
